#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0013-D expect=skipped domain=VS
#note "Scope.Domains.Include is CO only, so VS is out of CDISC-CG0013-D scope: VS is checked by the parent CDISC-CG0013. VSCUSTOM is a sponsor variable in no model list and in no grant, so the check would report it if the Include scope were dropped."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library model-column-order VS STUDYID DOMAIN USUBJID VSSEQ VSTESTCD VSTEST VSORRES
#library model-class-variables FINDINGS STUDYID:Identifier DOMAIN:Identifier USUBJID:Identifier --SEQ:Identifier --GRPID:Identifier --REFID:Identifier --SPID:Identifier --LNKID:Identifier --TESTCD:Topic VISITNUM:Timing VISIT:Timing VISITDY:Timing TAETORD:Timing EPOCH:Timing --DTC:Timing --STDTC:Timing --ENDTC:Timing --DY:Timing --STDY:Timing --ENDY:Timing --DUR:Timing --TPT:Timing --TPTNUM:Timing --ELTM:Timing --TPTREF:Timing --RFTDTC:Timing
dataset VS
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col VSSEQ type=Num
col VSTESTCD type=Char
col VSTEST type=Char
col VSORRES type=Char
col VSCUSTOM type=Char
---
S1 | VS | 001 | 1 | SYSBP | Systolic Blood Pressure | 120 | X
---
